    "Name": "Titanhauler T/HA-101",
    "Details": "The Titanhauler Cargo Transporter started production in the mid 26th century and saw extensive use both inside the inner Star League systems as well as new and growing colonies and periphery systems. Due to its heavy armor and large weapons loadout for a transport vehicle it was seen as a good solution to the increasing difficulty to source convoy escort units.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 4/6 hexes / 120/180 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Armor\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       235     40\n<b>Left</b>         180     40\n<b>Right</b>       180     40\n<b>Rear</b>        145     40\n<b>Turret</b>      180     40\n\n<b>Total</b>      920    200</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Rugged</color>",
